{{> head title="UI Potion - UI Behavior Guides for Coding Agents" description="UI behavior guides your coding agent can apply to your existing project. Each guide spells out how a piece of UI should behave; your agent builds it with your framework, components, and styling." currentPath="" }}

<div class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>UI behavior guides for your coding agent</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Each guide spells out how a piece of UI should behave, down to the details a short prompt misses. Your agent builds it into your project with your own components and styling.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#potions" class="button primary">Browse Potions</a>
      <a href="/about" class="button">How It Works</a>
    </div>
    {{> hero-demo}}
  </div>
</div>

<section id="potions" class="potions-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Available Potions</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Each potion is a detailed specification that AI agents can adapt into layouts, components, features, patterns, or tooling for an existing project.</p>

    {{postsList
      perPageLimit=6
      currentPage=1
      className="potions-grid"
      dateFormat='dd mmmm yyyy'
      noDate=true
    }}

    <div class="view-all-potions">
      <a href="/potions" class="button primary">View All Potions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-to-use">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How to Use</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">Copy prompt</div>
        <h3>Build it into your project</h3>
        <p>Open a potion, copy its prompt, and paste it into your coding agent, such as Claude Code, Codex, or Cursor. The agent builds the behavior with your components and styling.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">Check prompt</div>
        <h3>Check what you already have</h3>
        <p>Use a potion's check prompt to compare your existing UI with the guide. The agent lists the gaps by severity and changes nothing until you ask.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="how-to-use-alt">Or use <a href="/potion-kit">Potion Kit</a>: a CLI that lets you scaffold and chat-build Harold + UI Potion sites; the model uses only real potion specs from the catalog.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/hero-demo.js"></script>

{{> footer}}
